  "dct_description_sm": [
    "C-ICE is a multi-year, multi-disciplinary field experiment that has many individual projects, each with autonomous goals and objectives. Much of the science conducted has either directly or indirectly evolved from research postulates relating to one of four general themes - i) sea ice energy balance, ii) ecosystem studies, iii) remote sensing of snow covered sea ice, and iv) numerical modeling of atmospheric processes."
